# HYBRID diffuse continuum: canonical PALACE fcHO2 + fcFeO, LVM-refit fcO2Ac.
# Built 2026-09-10 to test whether the canonical set's blue deficit is the
# O2Ac component: canonical O2Ac peaks at 3220 A, outside the LVM window, so
# only its noisy UV tail lands in 3600-9800 A.
# lam/trans/fH2O/isX interpolated from canonical onto the native LVM grid;
# fcO2Ac copied verbatim from pmd_refcont_joint_native_adam_invsky_p2_10000iter.dat.
# Units unchanged: fc* are reference continuum flux in R/nm.
#
